    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the winter of 210 AD, the renowned genius strategist Zh\u014du Y\u00fa died of a sudden illness. Qi\u00e1o Q\u012bng, his widowed concubine, reminisces on their bittersweet relationship while going through the belongs in their bedroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, the player, will act on Qi\u00e1o Q\u012bng's behalf. Your choices will affect her sentiment, which in turn will affect how the game ends.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are a history lover and a<i>\u00a0</i>Three Kingdoms fan, this short game is a perfect treat for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Highlights</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual novel</strong>: a plot-centric story where your choices matter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden plotlines and endings unlocked after multiple playthroughs:</strong> different combinations and ordering of choices will lead to different outcomes. Some memories can only be unlocked over multiple playthroughs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich historical foundation with unlockable research:</strong> many details in the plot are based on<i> Three Kingdoms Records</i> and other historical scripts, and references are documented in a detailed research section for you to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Musical minigame: </strong>immerse yourself more in  Qi\u00e1o Q\u012bng's life by practicing music on her behalf</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bilingual:</strong> fully bilingual plot in English and Chinese (can be set in Settings)</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the winter of 210 AD, the renowned genius strategist Zh\u014du Y\u00fa died of a sudden illness. Qi\u00e1o Q\u012bng, his widowed concubine, reminisces on their bittersweet relationship while going through the belongs in their bedroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, the player, will act on Qi\u00e1o Q\u012bng's behalf. Your choices will affect her sentiment, which in turn will affect how the game ends.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are a history lover and a<i>\u00a0</i>Three Kingdoms fan, this short game is a perfect treat for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Highlights</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual novel</strong>: a plot-centric story where your choices matter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden plotlines and endings unlocked after multiple playthroughs:</strong> different combinations and ordering of choices will lead to different outcomes. Some memories can only be unlocked over multiple playthroughs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich historical foundation with unlockable research:</strong> many details in the plot are based on<i> Three Kingdoms Records</i> and other historical scripts, and references are documented in a detailed research section for you to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Musical minigame: </strong>immerse yourself more in  Qi\u00e1o Q\u012bng's life by practicing music on her behalf</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bilingual:</strong> fully bilingual plot in English and Chinese (can be set in Settings)</p></li></ul>",
